==Macedonian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|mk|sla-pro|*sę}}.

===Pronoun===
{{head|mk|pronoun form}}

# ''Short reflexive direct object pronoun.''

# {{label|mk|reflexive|clitic}} the accusative short form of the [[reflexive pronoun]] ''[[себе си]]'', part of [[reflexive verbs]], denoting that the subject is simultaneously the direct object; corresponds to [[myself]], [[yourself]], [[himself]], [[herself]], [[itself]], [[ourselves]], [[yourselves]], [[themselves]]
#: '''се''' сакам. - I love/like myself.''
#: '''се''' сака. - He/She/It [loves/likes] himself/herself/itself.''
# {{label|mk|reciprocal|clitic}} accusative [[reciprocal pronoun]], denoting that the agents perform the mutual actions among themselves; corresponds to [[each other]], [[one another]]
#: ''Марија и Петар '''се''' сакаат. - Maria and Petar [love/like] each other.''
# {{label|mk|reflexive|clitic}} [[reflexive pronoun]], part of [[w:Autocausative verb|autocausative verbs]], denoting that the referent represented by the subject combines the activity of actor and undergoes a change of state like a patient
#: ''Петар '''се''' навреди. - Peter became/was offended.''
# {{label|mk|reflexive|clitic}} [[reflexive pronoun]], part of [[w:Anticausative verb|anticausative verbs]], denoting that the subject of the verb undergoes an action or change of state whose agent is unclear or nonexistent
#: ''Вратата '''се''' отвори. - The door (was, got) opened.''
# {{label|mk|reflexive|clitic}} used for passive constructions with transitive verbs and undetermined agent
#: ''Од мојата куќа '''се''' гледа морето. - From my house the sea is seen/one can see the see.''
#: '''се''' вели, дека... - It is said that...''
# {{label|mk|reflexive|clitic}} used for passive constructions with transitive verbs and determined agent
#: ''Писмото '''се''' пишува од мене. - The letter is being written by me.
#: ''Куќата '''се''' проектира од познат архитект. - The house was designed by a famous architect.''
# {{label|mk|reflexive|clitic}} inherent part of an [[unergative]] reflexive or reciprocal verb with no meaning of its own, and an obligatory part of the verb's lexical entry
#: Јас '''се''' гордам со пишењето на Иво во училиштето. - I am proud of Sivu's schoolwork.''
#: ''Таа '''се''' надева да победи златен медал. - She is hoping to win the gold medal.''

